WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.600
Douro · Portugal

2
00:00:02.690 --> 00:00:04.950
2160 Onde Tudo Nasce. Colheita, red.

3
00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:07.270
An unmistakably Douro expression.

4
00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:08.730
So why 2160?

5
00:00:08.810 --> 00:00:12.500
It's a tribute to the altitude where the Douro river is born.

6
00:00:12.670 --> 00:00:16.670
The Douro rises at Urbión, in Spain, in the Sierra de Urbión.

7
00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:20.650
And from that point, where the water springs,

8
00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:24.480
we have a whole diversity, divided into what I'd call three rooms.

9
00:00:24.570 --> 00:00:27.770
We're talking about three completely different terroirs,

10
00:00:27.830 --> 00:00:31.370
with different ripening, different soils, different exposures.

11
00:00:31.510 --> 00:00:36.370
And the grapes we have here come from all three sub-regions,

12
00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:38.880
so it's hard to pin down one particular terroir,

13
00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:42.500
but it captures the Douro as a whole.

14
00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:46.530
Fresh, fruity, floral, mineral,

15
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.080
everything a balanced wine should have, in this bottle.

16
